  "guide": "Here `family` is the specified representative shell family, `Limit` is $A$, and `selectedAtomicRepresentation` is $\\pi$ on $\\mathcal H$. `shellFamilyLinks family` is the once-chosen $L$, and `ShellFamilyTarget family` is its fixed $T$. The RHS `AtomicConstruction.sourceHom` is $\\iota$, the codomain restriction of $\\pi$. The identity with inclusion and the separate injectivity theorem are separately cited; the definition does not choose a second link family.",
